nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:00:55.880 --> 00:01:02.010
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:07.230
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:07.230
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:13.230
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:13.230
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:18.570
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:18.570
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:23.120
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:23.120
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.330
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.330
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:29.880
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:37.590
It's morning! Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:50.770
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:51.180
Thanks.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:52.840
But, are you sure this is okay?

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:53.770
About what?

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:58.630
It's a rule that Spirits can't help out on school tests, right?

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:02.010
Preparing for the Grand Prix doesn't have anything to do with tests!

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:06.030
In fact, your grades have improved because of our help!

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:08.020
You're so aggressive...

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:15.660
Let's see here...

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:20.070
It tastes a bit like Nakajima-san's custard cream, but...

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.700
This'll work, right?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.370
Okay! Then let's make an apple cake petit gâteau.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:36.880
It looks pretty and tasty!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.690
And to top it off, apple slices!

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:43.140
Finished! I'll name it an "Apple Moon"!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.390
Ooh, cool!

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:51.420
recipe 38

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:51.420
The Closed Path

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:56.230
Oh? Where's Nakajima-san?

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.700
She went back to her room.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:59.450
Thanks!

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.370
Amano-san?

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.120
I said I wouldn't tell you, remember?

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.690
That's not what I'm asking...

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:16.070
I tried making my own custard cream.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.840
Would you taste it for me?

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.900
Well... If it's just a taste, then...

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:31.460
The apple compote and banana mousse are fine, yes?

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:35.730
But the custard is no good at all.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:39.780
You put too much apple juice into the custard cream so it's watery.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.460
Oh, I see. Thank you!

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.820
I'll remake it, so please taste it for me!

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:48.880
Other than the custard cream, it was perfect...

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.420
When did she...

00:03:56.440 --> 00:04:00.920
This time I made the custard cream stiffer. What do you think?

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.050
It's better than before, but still it's only so-so.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:07.700
The flavour of the custard is too strong and it overpowers everything.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:08.930
I see...

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:11.780
Then I'll remake it again!

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.640
Try using a bit less custard...

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:23.370
The apple flavour might be a little weak...

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:35.950
I'll make it once more!

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:38.070
Just mix in some apple jam!

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.960
Oh, I see!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.650
Thanks for telling me!

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.110
Wait a second.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:51.350
This is the same apple jam I used back then.

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.740
My mother makes it herself.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:55.090
Are you sure?

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.360
You have to make the jam yourself during the match, right?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:00.940
So use this as a reference...

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.070
Nakajima-san, thank y-

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:16.790
I tried making the petits gâteaus. What do you think?

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:21.210
So?

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.920
Ichigo-chan, they are very delicious.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.300
The colours go together well,

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.220
and the texture of the strawberry and passion fruit is perfect.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.760
Thank you!

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.760
For the actual match, I was thinking of making the strawberry on top out of candy,

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:35.290
and filling the inside with strawberry sauce!

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:37.040
That's a good idea.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.650
Vanilla suggested it.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:42.780
Hanabusa-kun, will you teach me how to make a candy strawberry later?

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.670
Sure, it'd be my pleasure.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.250
Amano-san, this apple cake is also incredible.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:51.010
The shape is unique, and the apple compote has a good consistency.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.760
But the best part is this amazing custard cream.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.000
Good going!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.700
This chocolate petit gâteau is also quite something.

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:02.500
It's all glossy, and the taste is neither too sweet or too bitter. It's perfect!

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:06.300
It's all thanks to Kashino's tempering training he gave me.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.510
Too bad Kashino didn't have a taste.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:12.310
Making the molds for the Eiffel Tower is a huge amount of work.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.520
Sure looks like it.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:17.200
With his personality, there's no way he'll stop for a second.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:20.790
He's got the most difficult role of all.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.230
Kashino, go for it!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.320
K-Kashino?

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:36.450
Oh, you're awake?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.940
You stayed up all night?

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:38.980
Yeah...

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.580
But I'm almost finished.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.920
Will you get a shower ready for me?

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.230
Understood.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.770
He won't compromise even a bit.

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:51.760
Well, I guess that's what makes Kashino so amazing.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:56.100
But... I sure hope he can keep his energy up during the match.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.850
All right!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:23.700
We will now begin the finals of the Cake Grand Prix!

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.170
First: Team Ichigo!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.710
Team Tennouji!

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.310
Commence cooking!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:37.240
It's so frustrating not being able to help!

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:40.680
Ichigo-chan hasn't done anything yet.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:43.100
Ichigo, what's the matter?

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.530
I'm visualising the order of preparation.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:49.830
Since the glass petit gâteau uses yogurt and mousse that easily melts,

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.760
I need to make them first and chill them right away.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.000
Is Ichigo-chan okay?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.380
We should cheer her on!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:58.210
You got that right!

00:08:58.210 --> 00:08:59.080
Ready, set...

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.910
Amano-san, fight!

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.210
Nakajima-san?

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:06.770
Is there something wrong with me cheering for our class's representative?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.270
Nope! Let's cheer together!

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:13.940
Team Ichigo, fight!

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.750
Thank you, everyone!

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.490
I got everything planned out.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.910
Okay, I'm gonna do my best!

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:42.430
When I was Mari's teacher, I recall her weakness was Sweets Crafts...

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:47.640
You must have practiced a great deal to dare to attempt the candy pièce montée.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:53.170
Damn... It took two and a half hours just to create the base.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.360
I have to hurry!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.130
Rui... Things are going well, yes?

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:03.400
I don't consider Kashino my rival here.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:06.370
My real competitor is you after all, Princess Mari.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:12.460
Hanabusa looks like he's proceeding well,

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:15.200
but Kashino seems to be having a lot of trouble.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.090
Kashino!

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:02.800
W-Where am I?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.000
The nurse's office.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.680
You fell unconscious while you were working.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.200
Why didn't you wake me up sooner?

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:12.020
We couldn't! We heard from Chocolat...

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.410
She said you didn't sleep a wink yesterday!

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:15.860
What a blabbermouth...

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.840
Anyway, we've got to return to the stage.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:19.670
We can't do that.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:20.860
It's the lunch break now.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:24.470
Damn it! And I barely had enough time to begin with...

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:27.370
Chocolate choux is the best when you're tired.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:28.820
Chocolat...

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.720
Thank you.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:36.770
Now that I think about it, I haven't had anything to eat since yesterday.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:37.750
Perfect timing then!

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:41.220
We have sandwiches that Vanilla and the others made!

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:56.380
Go, go, Makoto-kun!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:12:00.230
You can do it! You can do it! Makoto-kun!

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.390
Yohko! You're way too soft!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:04.920
Raise your voice big and loud!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:05.880
R-Right!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.950
Hurray! Hurray! Makoto-kun!

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:14.090
M-A-K-O-T-O Gogo!

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:17.910
Makoto-kun! Yay!

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:19.060
Ack, my eyes...

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:22.150
Stop that! The participants cannot concentrate!

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:23.680
But!

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.500
Please, Koshiro-san!

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.350
Kashino might faint again!

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:29.680
If you want to cheer, cheer him on in your heart!

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.490
Fine, I got it!

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.710
Kashino, can I wrap the roses around the Eiffel Tower?

00:12:59.100 --> 00:12:59.940
Sure...

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.590
There's only 5 minutes left!

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.970
We might not make it!

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.540
And they've almost finished it...

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:11.520
In that case... I'll have to break the clock!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.140
Don't do anything crazy!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.480
Okay, finished.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:22.670
Finished.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:27.910
He still has to put on that antenna looking thing on top...

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.760
Kashino, ten seconds!

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:38.950
Stop right there!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.820
Damn it! I didn't make it...

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:50.320
No... No! This is terrible!

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:52.820
Kashino...

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.540
I'm sorry...

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.360
I told everyone to give 200 percent, and then...

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:04.590
You gave it everything you had.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:07.570
You have nothing to be ashamed of.

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:14.100
Judging

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:14.100
Grand Prix           Final Round

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:29.260
You've displayed quite a number of different dreams, I see.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:35.770
The top being missing represents how all our dreams are as of yet, incomplete.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.940
That excuse is not going to work.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:42.480
I'll be subtracting points because you didn't complete it in time.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.490
Judgement Results

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:48.440
The pièce montée candy art sculpture and the pièce montée chocolate sculpture

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:53.320
will be judged on artistry, originality, and degree of completion.

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:57.890
The scores for Team Tennouji's pièce montée candy art sculpture:

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.830
Right off the bat, there's some incredible scores...

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.320
But just look at it, I mean...

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:15.360
Next, Team Ichigo:

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:23.690
A ten point difference... As I thought, we couldn't beat President Tennouji...

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:28.210
Continuing, we'll announce the scores for the pièce montée chocolate sculpture.

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.210
First, Team Tennouji:

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:35.590
Next, Team Ichigo:

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:43.890
Good job, Rui.

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:46.690
Not as good as you, Princess Mari, but I'll take it.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.880
Henri-sensei, that's way too harsh!

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:52.090
I'm sorry everyone...

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.380
Shake it off.

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:55.300
Yeah! We haven't lost yet!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.480
Makoto-kun...

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:00.570
The total scores so far:

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.140
A 59 point lead.

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:06.920
This is already over.

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.560
That is not true!

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:10.980
Andou and Ichigo worked really hard!

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:13.450
That's right! We still have a chance to make a comeback!

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:16.370
Well, that's something you should pray to the gods for.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:22.060
The entremet and petits gâteaus will be judged on taste and originality.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:25.250
Both of your cakes are quite exquisite.

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:29.320
We will now announce the scores for the entremet.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:30.850
Team Tennouji:

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.700
Team Ichigo:

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.690
Great, Andou-kun!

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:45.520
Yeah... But I only got us back 2 points...

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:49.370
Finally, we will now taste the petits gâteaus.

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:07.000
This is...

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:12.430
Henri-sensei hasn't smiled once, and yet just now...

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:18.970
We will now announce the scores for the petits gâteaus.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.470
Team Tennouji:

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:33.280
Ryo, you cannot deceive our tongues.

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:40.710
Your petits gâteaus were simply a re-arrangement of different World Pâtissier champion's prize-winners.

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:43.700
Therefore you lost points for originality.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.270
Is that true, Ryo?

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.550
With this, they need at least 477 points.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:55.580
It's nothing to get upset about.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.070
You must not underestimate Amano-san.

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:01.570
Now, we will announce the scores for Team Ichigo.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:11.320
What incredibly high scores!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:14.040
Everything will be decided by Henri-sensei's score...

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.550
Please, God!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:21.820
Henri-sensei gave me 97 points!

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:24.080
That's a higher score than I got!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.120
Amazing, Amano-san!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.250
Good for you.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.790
Who won?!

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:40.020
All right!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:44.680
I'm sorry...

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.270
What are you talking about?

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.510
Thanks to you we ended up only one point behind!

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:49.070
That's right!

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:50.920
You did great, Ichigo-chan!

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:52.740
We were so close...

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:54.650
But it was an excellent battle.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:16.230
I'll see you again in Paris.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:24.070
Henri-sensei will now give some general remarks.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:28.080
To everyone on Team Tennouji, congratulations on your victory.

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:31.610
If you improve your originality, even though you'll be up against strong opponents,

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:36.730
I feel you have a good chance at winning the World Cake Grand Prix happening in Paris.

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:41.360
And even though you lost, I was surprised by the fight you put up, Team Ichigo.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.410
You're far beyond the level of middle schoolers.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:47.160
Kashino, you have nothing to be ashamed of.

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:48.800
Raise your head.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:52.260
If you had completed it within the time limit,

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:55.290
I would have given you a higher score than Rui.

00:19:57.990 --> 00:20:01.880
Ichigo, your petits gâteaus surprised me the most.

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:04.700
You still have a lot to learn about the technique,

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:09.170
but you put your feelings into each of the three petit gâteau

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:13.160
and I could sense the incredible talent you have to put a smile on people's faces.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:16.150
Henri-sensei...

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:21.120
A while ago, I asked permission from the Chairman of the main campus in Paris.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:24.930
And in recognition of the high level of the Japanese St. Marie Academy boarding school,

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:30.390
Team Ichigo will also be invited to the World Cake Grand Prix as the Team B representative from Japan.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.860
We can go to Paris, too?

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.000
Yes.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.940
All right!

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:41.250
Congratulations, Ichigo-chan!

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:42.820
