00:23:03.280 --> 00:23:04.800
Custard cream!

00:23:07.620 --> 00:23:13.440
This time, we will demonstrate the Western confectionery basic way of making custard cream!

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:17.980
Custard Cream in French means Creme Pâtissière.

00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:23.790
Even if it's called "cream of the pastry chef", cream is undeniably a necessity in making of the cake.

00:23:24.160 --> 00:23:28.940
First, mix egg and sugar well until it becomes creamy.

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:30.800
Then add in wheat flour and mix it.

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:35.220
Heat milk until it's before its boiling point and turn off the fire.

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:40.810
Add the milk into the dough carefully, and use a whipper to mix it quickly.

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:47.120
Turn on a weak flame again, and use a spatula to stir the dough while heating it without causing it to boil.

00:23:47.120 --> 00:23:52.110
At this time, we stir it slowly to prevent it from burning.

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:57.230
When the stream starts to rise in puffs slowly from the cream, then it's completed!

00:23:57.230 --> 00:23:59.750
Remember to refrigerate it before using it!

